prompt kg -- the choir's first sing was the recommend, and the lap turned where the ground was clear.
think The sing waits on purpose: the sibling hand stands mid-flight repairing caravan's own Linux-syscall seams for this bench (std.os.linux.waitpid answering a constant 9 on macOS, %282 booked in their own comment), and a choir sung over half-done repairs proves neither tree. So the lap took the constellation table's next unpicked move on non-colliding ground: the tally room's module-to-witness roster meter, the choir-and-bijection calling reaching the allocator.
think tools/fixtures/tally_roster_scan.sh reads the room off disk: fourteen modules, five covered by an ANCHORED name match (tally_<m>.rish or tally_<m>_*.rish -- tally_budget can never credit bud, the flag-inside-a-longer-word lesson in the matcher itself), three test programs as named exceptions proven through what composes them, and six uncovered -- bud, kumara, pedersen, region, seed, stack -- held as a ratchet under a ceiling of six that only falls. pedersen stays IN the ratchet on purpose: a shim to an uncovered module is not covered by pointing at it. The honest limit is named in the header: an anchored name is ownership by convention, not yet a run-relationship -- when the fusion map lands, the matcher trades name-adjacency for what a witness actually consumes.
think tools/t/tally_roster_witness.rish proved the fence from both sides in a pen: the live room whole and seen, a planted newborn refused past a ceiling of zero and NAMED, the longer-word plant crediting nothing, and the healed pen (every plant given its check) passing at zero -- covering is the door the ceiling falls through. The guard seated on the standing roster as tally_roster, tier lap; the card's counted line synced to 74 guards, 70 every-lap, 4 cadence.
obs The council rota completed its full wheel this session: aether, fire, water, earth, and now air -- whose canon shaped this very meter (a boundary a hand can press; report the uncovered, refuse nothing done on purpose; the pen pressing the fence from both sides).
obs Keaton pasted the Sound outer loop line into the bench -- the 24/7 loop lights in the Terminal. This send lands the tree whole ahead of its first lap; the loop opens on the fusion standfast and this very meter breathes in its roster.
